    "norm": "Tests {@link BinaryCodec#decode(byte[])}. <p> {@code decode(byte[])} reads a string of ASCII '0'/'1' characters (8 chars per output byte) and returns the packed raw bytes. The decoder treats the right-most group of 8 characters as the first output byte, so for multi-byte inputs the byte order is reversed relative to the textual order. </p>"
   },
